* B1 screw/pluggable terminal overcurrent flag: flag=1 when I_contact > Irated*derate
* MSTB 2,5 rated 12 A (Phoenix 1757019); derate 1.0 single, 0.8 assumed for all positions loaded
.param Irated=12 derate=0.8 Iload=10 Rc=3m
Vs a 0 12
Rl a b {12/Iload-2*Rc}
Vsense b c 0
Rcon c 0 {2*Rc}
* flag source
Bflag flag 0 V = (i(Vsense) > {Irated}*{derate}) ? 1 : 0
Rf flag 0 1G
* power in contact: I^2 * Rcontact
Bp pw 0 V = i(Vsense)**2 * {2*Rc}
Rp pw 0 1G
.control
op
print i(Vsense) v(flag) v(pw)
let expectI = 10
let expectP = 100*0.006
print expectI expectP
alter Vs 15
alter Rl 0
quit
.endc
.end
